# --- Language/Manager Specifics ---
# Go: Ignore the heavy dependency downloads and compiled binaries
**/go/pkg/
**/go/bin/

# Bob (Neovim version manager): 
# Don't track the downloaded Neovim versions/binaries themselves
**/bob/nvim-bin/
**/bob/downloads/

# --- Game Dev & Apps ---
# Unity3D: These can get huge and are usually machine-specific logs/caches
**/unity3d/Editor/
**/unity3d/cache/
**/*.log

# Vesktop/Electron: Ignore local session data/cache
**/vesktop/Cache/
**/vesktop/GPUCache/
**/vesktop/session/
# Vesktop / Discord specifics
**/vesktop/Crashpad/
**/vesktop/sessionData/
**/vesktop/Singleton*
**/vesktop/state.json

# --- System & General Garbage ---
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.tmp
*~

# --- Zig Specifics (for when you start your kernel projects) ---
# If you keep your Zig projects inside your dotfiles folder
zig-cache/
zig-out/
